                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c2bdf64c-ec0c-30e4-ae24-77dc29c35396",
                        "entry_id": "04b31a6c-1bf1-31c8-8933-1842575875cf",
                        "glosses": [
                            "ein Zustand der Verwahrlosung"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "243e7f60-a2ab-40e0-9152-581590cd55e9",
                                "sense_id": "c2bdf64c-ec0c-30e4-ae24-77dc29c35396",
                                "text": "„Meine Tiere mußten unter meiner Verkommenheit selbstverständlich ganz besonders leiden.“"
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "67564606-8a53-4749-8537-cdc0ec4b623f",
                        "source_entry_id": "04b31a6c-1bf1-31c8-8933-1842575875cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "c2bdf64c-ec0c-30e4-ae24-77dc29c35396",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein Zustand der Verwahrlosung",
                        "target_lang_word": "depravity",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "depravity",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "867a54fc-31d9-3c7a-ae5c-a6b81c9dd40d",
                                        "entry_id": "21e24839-7d40-3713-ae64-c52a5ba29107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state or condition of being depraved; moral debasement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "54d5f83a-cd92-44e3-826d-691f8b5f4e35",
                                                "sense_id": "867a54fc-31d9-3c7a-ae5c-a6b81c9dd40d",
                                                "text": "Depravity in the oppressed is no apology for the oppressor."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cda58c06-0eda-4a95-acc5-9a21aa66aa3d",
                                                "sense_id": "867a54fc-31d9-3c7a-ae5c-a6b81c9dd40d",
                                                "text": "Walsingham was not blind to Edward’s failings, and attributed the political problems of the 1370s directly to the old king’s moral depravity."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4e0abaf-3773-4588-bc36-3b9bff0d1502",
                                                "sense_id": "867a54fc-31d9-3c7a-ae5c-a6b81c9dd40d",
                                                "text": "“Whoa. Baby Bear. What's the matter?” “I know I'm not supposed to ask you how you came back from the dead, but I know it was my fault that you died. And maybe if you tell me how you came back, I won't feel as guilty anymore!” “Turbolift, halt.” (whirring stops) “It wasn't your fault. Saving you was my duty. There's a reason we don't tell anyone how we come back.” “I know. You can't tell me because I'm just an ensign.” “It's nothing to do with rank, son. We're sparing you dark truths about scientific depravity that would haunt you for the rest of your days. Once you know, you can never go back to being the man you were before.” “Works for me! Tell me, tell me!” “Okay. So, death is the first thing that happens. And then-- Oh, wait, you do know about the black mountain, right?” “Uh, the what now?” “The black mountain is a spiritual battleground your soul goes (muffled): where you have to fight three faceless apparitions of your father. (fading): ...the surviving father makes you eat your heart...”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "2245ac51-12e4-3e24-9ee0-e09403a21534",
                                        "entry_id": "21e24839-7d40-3713-ae64-c52a5ba29107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A particular depraved act or trait."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f8d1c007-0fa7-4d5a-8cb6-c7038ad514d7",
                                                "sense_id": "2245ac51-12e4-3e24-9ee0-e09403a21534",
                                                "text": "There were men there who had committed merciless robberies, cruel murders, heartless swindles, abominable depravities."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "4ba04b1a-4c26-31c9-afd0-787791c1d725",
                                        "entry_id": "21e24839-7d40-3713-ae64-c52a5ba29107",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Inborn corruption, entailing the belief that every facet of human nature has been polluted, defiled, and contaminated by sin."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Christian",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b50d5ba8-c4c8-4854-bc12-3d564fa003ce",
                                                "sense_id": "4ba04b1a-4c26-31c9-afd0-787791c1d725",
                                                "text": "Here is a child of three years old, and she cannot tell who made her! Without question, she is equally in the dark as to her soul, its present depravity, and future destiny!"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "956402cf-6cb3-4d6e-a149-606cc0e5e820",
                        "source_entry_id": "04b31a6c-1bf1-31c8-8933-1842575875cf",
                        "source_sense_id": "c2bdf64c-ec0c-30e4-ae24-77dc29c35396",
                        "source_sense_description": "ein Zustand der Verwahrlosung",
                        "target_lang_word": "dépravation",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "dépravation",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "24f7252e-6caa-3c4d-9348-0d4b8a303b89",
                                        "entry_id": "207f9d4c-4b3a-3efc-9d0c-51b41455404e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "État de ce qui est dépravé."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "cf615839-da5b-419a-980b-a96017696d42",
                                                "sense_id": "24f7252e-6caa-3c4d-9348-0d4b8a303b89",
                                                "text": "Le sieur Jean-Paul-Stanislas Marneffe appartenait à cette nature d’employés qui résiste à l’abrutissement par l’espèce de puissance que donne la dépravation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a33d4245-080f-4f5b-8df1-8355549a8b62",
                                                "sense_id": "24f7252e-6caa-3c4d-9348-0d4b8a303b89",
                                                "text": "Si c’est le désir d’animer votre monotone existence de jeune fille curieuse qui vous a mis la plume à la main, ceci n’a-t-il pas l’apparence d’une dépravation ?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb5732ff-5710-493a-95f7-b16a0972c385",
                                                "sense_id": "24f7252e-6caa-3c4d-9348-0d4b8a303b89",
                                                "text": "Cette naïveté de dépravation causa au comte de Morvelle un sentiment de dégoût qu'il aurait eu peine à contenir."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "546e07d9-e636-3339-8aee-b1ab6642603c",
                                        "entry_id": "207f9d4c-4b3a-3efc-9d0c-51b41455404e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Vice de quelqu'un, de quelque chose, qui a de mauvaises mœurs, qui est sans moralité."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "26346402-5442-4857-8f60-82b6223208ca",
                                                "sense_id": "546e07d9-e636-3339-8aee-b1ab6642603c",
                                                "text": "Quant aux gens qui, par peur de l'enfantement, se condamnent à la continence absolue, il est avéré qu'ils sont incomparablement plus que les autres individus, portés à des dépravations bien plus néfastes, à tous les points de vue, que ne le sont les pires abus dans les rapports normaux."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f69dd31b-9c13-48ca-92c0-1faabd00dba3",
                                                "sense_id": "546e07d9-e636-3339-8aee-b1ab6642603c",
                                                "text": "A ces dévergondages, à ces déliquescences, à ces dépravations, il y a de douloureuses conséquences. […] ; une partie de la jeunesse aurait été atteinte en sa constitution physique, aux sources mêmes de la vie."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
